---
source: libs/extractor/src/runtime_options.rs
expression: "errors(code, names)"
---
[
    (
        197,
        "`stylisPlugins` of `createCache()` from `@emotion/cache` runs stylis plugins over the CSS at runtime, which Devup UI does not compile, so the plugins would never reach the stylesheet. Fix: write the CSS the plugins would produce into the styles, or set `importAliases: { '@emotion/react': false, '@emotion/styled': false }` and build with Emotion",
    ),
    (
        256,
        "`stylisPlugins` of `createCache()` from `@emotion/cache` runs stylis plugins over the CSS at runtime, which Devup UI does not compile, so the plugins would never reach the stylesheet. Fix: write the CSS the plugins would produce into the styles, or set `importAliases: { '@emotion/react': false, '@emotion/styled': false }` and build with Emotion",
    ),
    (
        279,
        "`createCache()` from `@emotion/cache` takes an option of a computed key, so whether the options of `createCache()` set `stylisPlugins`, which Devup UI does not compile, cannot be known at build time. Fix: `import createCache from '@emotion/cache'` and call it with an object literal of options, or set `importAliases: { '@emotion/react': false, '@emotion/styled': false }` and build with Emotion",
    ),
    (
        290,
        "`createCache()` from `@emotion/cache` takes spread options, so whether the options of `createCache()` set `stylisPlugins`, which Devup UI does not compile, cannot be known at build time. Fix: `import createCache from '@emotion/cache'` and call it with an object literal of options, or set `importAliases: { '@emotion/react': false, '@emotion/styled': false }` and build with Emotion",
    ),
    (
        331,
        "`createCache()` from `@emotion/cache` takes options that are not an object literal, so whether the options of `createCache()` set `stylisPlugins`, which Devup UI does not compile, cannot be known at build time. Fix: `import createCache from '@emotion/cache'` and call it with an object literal of options, or set `importAliases: { '@emotion/react': false, '@emotion/styled': false }` and build with Emotion",
    ),
    (
        450,
        "`createCache` from `@emotion/cache` is used other than by calling it, so whether the options of `createCache()` set `stylisPlugins`, which Devup UI does not compile, cannot be known at build time. Fix: `import createCache from '@emotion/cache'` and call it with an object literal of options, or set `importAliases: { '@emotion/react': false, '@emotion/styled': false }` and build with Emotion",
    ),
]
